+<main>
+<dl class="strip" aria-label="Summary">
+<div><dt>Reads (R1+R2)</dt><dd>10</dd></div>
+<div><dt>Bases</dt><dd>50 bp</dd></div>
+<div><dt>N50</dt><dd>5 bp<span class="sub">half of all bases are in reads at least this long</span></dd></div>
+<div><dt>Mean Q</dt><dd>16.2<span class="sub">average base quality (Q30 = 1 error in 1000 bases)</span></dd></div>
+<div><dt>% mapped</dt><dd>90.0%</dd></div>
+<div><dt>% MAPQ &gt;= 30</dt><dd>40.0%<span class="sub">reads placed with high confidence</span></dd></div>
+<div><dt>% bases clipped</dt><dd>0.0%<span class="sub">ends the aligner trimmed off</span></dd></div>
+<div><dt>Median identity</dt><dd>n/a</dd></div>
+</dl>
+<ul class="notes" aria-label="Notes">
+<li>Only 10 reads: per-position plots (3-5) are not reliable and are hidden.</li>
+<li>Identity unavailable for 9 of 9 mapped reads (no NM tag and no =/X operations).</li>
+</ul>
