+</table>
+</div>
+</section>
+<section class="plot" id="plot-1" aria-labelledby="plot-1-title">
+<h2 id="plot-1-title"><span class="num">1.</span> How long are the reads?</h2>
+<div class="figs">
+<p class="plot-note">All 10,001 reads are 1 bp long.</p>
+</div>
+</section>
+<section class="plot" id="plot-2" aria-labelledby="plot-2-title">
+<h2 id="plot-2-title"><span class="num">2.</span> How good is each read?</h2>
+<p class="caption">Reads by their average base quality (higher is better; Q20 = 1 error in 100 bases, Q30 = 1 in 1000).</p>
+<div class="figs">
