+</div>
+<p class="good"><strong>What good looks like:</strong> A flat line or a slow decline towards the end of the read.</p>
+<details>
+<summary>How to read plot 3</summary>
+<div class="howto">
+<p><strong>Worth a look:</strong> A sudden drop at one position (a failed cycle) or a steep decline that suggests trimming.</p>
+<p><strong>Often benign:</strong> The first few positions are slightly lower; long-read files use % of read length as the axis, which dilutes effects in the first few bases.</p>
+</div>
+</details>
+</section>
+<section class="plot" id="plot-4" aria-labelledby="plot-4-title">
+<h2 id="plot-4-title"><span class="num">4.</span> Is base composition even along the read?</h2>
+<p class="caption">Percentage of A, C, G, T and N at each position along the read, one row per MAPQ class.</p>
+<div class="figs">
+<p class="plot-key"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-labelledby="samstat-p4-key-t samstat-p4-key-d" width="325.4" height="25.2" viewBox="0 0 325.4 25.2" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;vertical-align:top" font-family="system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif" font-size="14" fill="#1a1a1a"><title id="samstat-p4-key-t">Line key for the base composition plot</title><desc id="samstat-p4-key-d">Line key for the bases: A green, solid line; C blue, dashed line; G orange, dotted line; T red, dash-dot line; N grey, long-dashed line</desc><path fill="none" stroke="#009600" stroke-width="2.5" d="M2,12.6H38"/><text x="44" y="17.5">A</text><path fill="none" stroke="#0000FF" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-dasharray="6 3" d="M66.7,12.6H102.7"/><text x="108.7" y="17.5">C</text><path fill="none" stroke="#D17105" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-dasharray="2 3" d="M131.4,12.6H167.4"/><text x="173.4" y="17.5">G</text><path fill="none" stroke="#FF0000" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-dasharray="8 3 2 3" d="M196,12.6H232"/><text x="238" y="17.5">T</text><path fill="none" stroke="#808080" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-dasharray="12 3" d="M260.7,12.6H296.7"/><text x="302.7" y="17.5">N</text></svg>
