+<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-labelledby="samstat-p4-t samstat-p4-d" width="640" height="187.8" viewBox="0 0 640 187.8" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;vertical-align:top" font-family="system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif" font-size="14" fill="#1a1a1a"><title id="samstat-p4-t">Is base composition even along the read?</title><desc id="samstat-p4-d">Percentage of A, C, G, T and N at each position along the read, from position 1 to position 2, aligned part of the read, one row per MAPQ class, sharing the position axis. Rows: MAPQ &gt;= 30. One line per base, each with its own dash pattern; the line key is above the figure. In each row, positions covered by fewer than 50 reads of that class are not drawn.</desc><rect width="640" height="187.8" fill="#fff"/><path fill="none" stroke="#e4e4e4" stroke-width="1" d="M77,140.2H619M77,86.2H619M77,32.2H619"/><path fill="none" stroke="#595959" stroke-width="1" d="M77,32.2V140.2H619M348,140.2v4M77,140.2h-4M77,86.2h-4M77,32.2h-4"/><text x="77" y="20.3" font-weight="bold">MAPQ &gt;= 30</text><text x="348" y="157.7" text-anchor="middle">1</text><text x="348" y="179.4" text-anchor="middle">position in read (bp), aligned part</text><text x="70" y="145.1" text-anchor="end">0</text><text x="70" y="91.1" text-anchor="end">50</text><text x="70" y="37.1" text-anchor="end">100</text><text transform="translate(13.3 86.2) rotate(-90)" text-anchor="middle">% of bases</text><path fill="none" stroke="#009600" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M347.2,32.2H348.8"><title>Base A, MAPQ &gt;= 30</title></path><path fill="none" stroke="#0000FF" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-dasharray="6 3" d="M347.2,140.2H348.8"><title>Base C, MAPQ &gt;= 30</title></path><path fill="none" stroke="#D17105" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-dasharray="2 3" d="M347.2,140.2H348.8"><title>Base G, MAPQ &gt;= 30</title></path><path fill="none" stroke="#FF0000" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-dasharray="8 3 2 3" d="M347.2,140.2H348.8"><title>Base T, MAPQ &gt;= 30</title></path><path fill="none" stroke="#808080" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-dasharray="12 3" d="M347.2,140.2H348.8"><title>Base N, MAPQ &gt;= 30</title></path></svg>
